  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Primitive Pick\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2H_Primitive_Pick.png\" title=\"Primitive Pick\"><img alt=\"Primitive Pick\" border=\"0\" src=\"/images/recovered/2H_Primitive_Pick.png\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Damage Type:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Piercing\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Wielding:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Two-Handed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Attack Speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Slothful\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client weapon speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">75\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client damage coeff:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">1.33\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Primitive Pick</b> is listed on the <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Two-Handed-fighter\" title=\"Category:Two-Handed-fighter\">Two-Handed-fighter</a> weapon list. Stats on this page come from that list and the Dungeon Runners client files.</p>\n<p>The client also has material-tier versions of this weapon (Cardboard Primitive Pick, Celestial Primitive Pick, Diamond Primitive Pick, Iron Primitive Pick, Obsidian Primitive Pick, Stone Primitive Pick, Tin Primitive Pick, Titanium Primitive Pick, \u2026).</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
